 ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Development only, and it does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"more than its name says.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" AXIAM’s shared SSRF guard couples the scheme rule to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"address rule — the same seam that lets an integration test point a fetch at a loopback","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"mock server — so a tenant that allows ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"http"},{"text":" also allows the first hop to resolve to a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"private address. Redirect hops are validated strictly whatever this says, and a public","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deployment that sets it has removed the control that makes ","type":"text"},{"code":"169.254.169.254","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"unreachable.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/CimdPolicy\/allowHttp","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/cimdpolicy\/allowhttp"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/CimdPolicy/enabled":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/CimdPolicy\/enabled","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enabled"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"abstract":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Off unless somebody turns it on","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (I1). With this ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":", a URL-shaped ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"client_id"},{"text":" is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exactly today’s unknown client: nothing is fetched, nothing is materialised, and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ordinary repository lookup